usage: plan.py finish [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --status
                      {done,done_with_deviations,blocked,skipped}
                      [--notes NOTES] [--check V1=0] [--deviation TEXT]
                      [--pending TEXT] [--escalation ESCALATION]
                      [--commit SHA] [--decision D#] [--actor ACTOR]
                      [--executed-by PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT]]
                      [--attempt-id ID] [--evidence V1=PATH] [--json]
                      plan item

record the outcome of an item; closes the phase and the plan when complete

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  item

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --status {done,done_with_deviations,blocked,skipped}
  --notes NOTES
  --check V1=0          acceptance check outcome (repeatable)
  --deviation TEXT
  --pending TEXT
  --escalation ESCALATION
                        what the owner must decide or provide (blocked)
  --commit SHA
  --decision D#         accepted decision that skips the item (skipped)
  --actor ACTOR         PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT] registering the outcome
                        (default: the item executor)
  --executed-by PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT]
                        who executed the item; route-checked, replaces
                        result.executor
  --attempt-id ID       registration attempt; a repeat of it is a no-op
  --evidence V1=PATH    check-evidence file (Task field contract; see `plan.py
                        schema check-evidence`) whose exit is the check result
                        (repeatable)
  --json
